computation of this API to save the buffer space.
If this parameter is set to false, the inputDy
buffer space is not reused, and extra temporary
buffer is allocated during internal computation of
this API. After this API is called, the temporary
buffer is automatically deallocated.
This parameter can be enabled for float input
